The acceptance criteria should be:

### Visual

* Looks professionally designed
* Strong hierarchy
* Consistent spacing
* No generic template feeling
* Real Nest branding
* Premium photography

### UX

* Visitor understands Nest immediately
* Pricing is easy to find
* Seat options are obvious
* CTA is always accessible
* Forms are simple
* Mobile navigation is excellent

### Technical

* No TypeScript errors
* No ESLint errors
* Build passes
* Tests pass
* No horizontal overflow
* No console errors
* Images optimized
* Accessible
* Reduced motion works

### Business

* Opening offer visible
* Standard pricing visible
* WhatsApp works
* Call works
* Visit enquiry works
* Seat enquiry works
* Membership enquiry works
* Directions works when address is configured

